# Development server state: world saves, generated config, copied-in mods and the
# whitelist/op/banned lists that the game writes into its own game directory.
# Anchored to the repository root so package directories such as
# src/main/java/com/forestrytweaks/config stay tracked.
/world/
/config/
/defaultconfigs/
/mods/
/patchouli_books/
/server.properties
/session.lock
/eula.txt
/ops.json
/whitelist.json
/banned-ips.json
/banned-players.json
/usercache.json
*.log

